  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical support and services primarily to UNEP.

Outcomes 

1. Enhanced resilience and adaptation to climate change and reduced greenhouse gas emissions reduce climate risks on     people and planet.
2. Ocean and coastal ecosystems, and the communities who rely on them, are healthy, prosperous, and resilien.t
3. Exposure of people and planet to harmful chemicals and pollution reduced.</narrative>
  </description>
